---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { breadcrumbSchema } from "../../lib/schema";

const pagePath = "/privacy-policy/";
const schema = breadcrumbSchema([
  { name: "Home", path: "/" },
  { name: "Privacy Policy", path: pagePath },
]);
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — VEDHA"
  description="How Vedha Technologies collects, uses and protects personal information when you use our website, contact us, or work with us on a software project."
>
  <article class="legal">
    <header class="legal__intro">
      <p class="kicker">(Legal)</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>
        This policy explains how Vedha Technologies LLC-FZ (“Vedha”, “we”, “us”) handles personal information
        when you visit vedha.ae, send an enquiry, or engage us for software, design, or related services.
      </p>
      <p class="legal__meta">Last updated: 17 October 2026</p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Vedha Technologies LLC-FZ is a software development company based in Dubai, United Arab Emirates.
        We design and build websites, applications, and related digital systems for businesses.
      </p>
      <p>
        For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:info@vedha.ae">info@vedha.ae</a> or write to us in Dubai,
        United Arab Emirates. You can also call <a href="tel:+971506583342">(+971) 50 658 3342</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>We collect only what we need to respond to you and to deliver our work.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Enquiries and forms.</strong> Name, email address, mobile number, company, service interest,
          project description, budget, and similar details you submit through our contact form, service enquiry
          popup, landing pages, newsletter signup, or website cost estimator.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Project information.</strong> If you become a client, we may receive business details, files,
          access to staging or production systems, and messages needed to scope, build, and support the work.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Website use.</strong> Standard technical data such as browser type, device, pages viewed,
          and approximate location derived from an IP address. If analytics is enabled, Google Analytics may
          set cookies to understand how the site is used.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Bookings.</strong> Consultation bookings open a Google Calendar scheduling page. Google
          processes the details you enter there under its own terms.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not ask you to send passwords or payment card numbers through our website forms.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Reply to enquiries and prepare proposals or estimates.</li>
        <li>Deliver, support, and improve the services you ask us to provide.</li>
        <li>Send a confirmation when you submit a form, and project updates you expect from us.</li>
        <li>Keep a record of leads and conversations so the right person can follow up.</li>
        <li>Understand which pages and campaigns bring useful enquiries.</li>
        <li>Protect the website, our clients, and our business from misuse or security issues.</li>
        <li>Meet legal, accounting, and record-keeping duties that apply to a company in the UAE.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not sell personal information. We do not use enquiry details for unrelated marketing lists.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>We share information only when it is needed to run the business or when the law requires it.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Email and hosting providers that send messages and store form submissions.</li>
        <li>Analytics providers, when measurement is turned on for the website.</li>
        <li>Google, when you book a consultation through the calendar widget.</li>
        <li>Professional advisers such as accountants or lawyers, where a matter requires it.</li>
        <li>Authorities, if we must disclose information to comply with applicable law.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        People who process data for us are expected to use it only for the task we give them and to protect it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiry records are kept for as long as we need them to respond, follow up, and keep a reasonable
        business history — typically up to 24 months if we do not start a project. Client project records,
        contracts, and invoices are kept for the life of the engagement and for the period required by UAE
        commercial and accounting practice after it ends. Analytics data follows the retention settings of
        the analytics tool.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        We use reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect personal information, including
        access limits and secure transmission where the tools we use support it. No website or email system
        is completely risk-free. Please avoid sending highly sensitive secrets in a public contact form.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Tell you what personal information we hold about you.</li>
        <li>Correct information that is inaccurate.</li>
        <li>Delete information we no longer need, unless we must keep it for a legal or contractual reason.</li>
        <li>Stop using your details for a particular follow-up.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:info@vedha.ae">info@vedha.ae</a> with your request. We may need to confirm
        that the request comes from you. Where the UAE Personal Data Protection Law applies to the
        information, we will handle the request in line with that law.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>International visitors</h2>
      <p>
        Vedha is based in Dubai. If you contact us from outside the UAE, your information may be processed
        in the UAE and by service providers in other countries that host our email, website, or analytics.
        We only do this to operate the site and to respond to you.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may link to client work, tools, or partners. Those sites have their own privacy practices.
        This policy covers vedha.ae and the services we provide, not third-party websites.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        Our services are for businesses and adults. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this page when our services or the law change. The date at the top shows the latest version.
        Continued use of the website after an update means you are reading the current policy.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Vedha Technologies LLC-FZ<br />
        Dubai, United Arab Emirates<br />
        <a href="mailto:info@vedha.ae">info@vedha.ae</a><br />
        <a href="tel:+971506583342">(+971) 50 658 3342</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    width: 100%;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding:
      calc(6.5rem + clamp(1.5rem, 4vh, 2.5rem))
      var(--gutter)
      clamp(4.5rem, 12vh, 8rem);
  }
  .legal__intro {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--stack-md);
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.4rem, 6vh, 3.6rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(1.8rem, 4vh, 2.6rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .legal h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.4rem);
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
  }
  .legal__intro > p:not(.kicker):not(.legal__meta) {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 42rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }
  .legal__meta {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .legal section {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin-top: clamp(1.8rem, 4vh, 2.6rem);
  }
  .legal h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.55rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .legal p,
  .legal li {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .legal ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.15rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }
  .legal a {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .legal strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
